schway-screen 1
screen approval-command
title Approve a command
description A mutating command waits for an interactive approval choice.
variant nocolor-dark-40x8
size 40x8
cursor 1 1 hidden
== text
  Allow bash? · ask mode

  bun test --filter clamp

